CONSTANTS Nodes, MaxValue, FaultyNodes

ASSUME IsFiniteSet(Nodes)
ASSUME Cardinality(Nodes) >= 3
ASSUME MaxValue \in Nat
ASSUME FaultyNodes \subseteq Nodes

VARIABLES
    nodeState,
    proposedValue,
    votedValue,
    decidedValue,
    round,
    messages

